### 결제 요청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
X-USER-ID: user123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORDER-{{$timestamp}}",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 10000
}

> {%
    client.global.set("transactionKey", response.body.transactionKey);
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.orderId);
%}

### 결제 상태 수동 동기화
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/sync?transactionKey={{transactionKey}}
X-USER-ID: user123

### 결제 콜백 (PG에서 호출 - 테스트용)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "{{transactionKey}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": null
}

### 결제 콜백 - 실패 케이스
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "{{transactionKey}}",
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "status": "FAILED",
  "reason": "한도 초과"
}
